This directory holds the persisted index.

  index.json      inverted index (postings, document lengths, corpus stats)
  documents.json  document store (url, title, extracted text, metadata)
  stats.json      index + last crawl summary

The files are generated by crawling and are intentionally not committed.
Run `npm run demo` (offline, uses the bundled fixture site) or
`npm run crawl -- --seeds https://example.com` to populate them.
